ed with visual indicator"],[1416,"**Keyboard navigation**: Bar groups are keyboard accessible with `tabIndex={0}` and `role=\"group\"`"],[1084,"**Label, description, error**: Optional label, helper text, and error message with proper accessibility"],[1245,"**Label, description, error**: Optional label, helper text, and error message with proper accessibility"],[654,"**Layout primitive**: `ListBox` and `ListBoxItem` accept layout props (`gap`, `padding`, etc.) — they extend `FlexOwnProps`."],[1330,"**Left** — when the group controls content directly below or within the same column (dashboards, tables)."],[1449,"**Limit data points**: Consider pagination or filtering for very large datasets (>100 points)"],[574,"**Lower Memory Usage**: Especially beneficial with many repeated icons"],[1411,"**Margins**: 20px top/right, 60px bottom/left for axes and labels"],[682,"**Menu Items:** `data-hovered`, `data-focused`, `data-pressed`, `data-selected`, `data-disabled`"],[591,"**Minimize icon sets**: Only load icons that are actually used"],[1415,"**Minimum spacing**: Group gaps never fall below 24px, triggering scroll instead"],[1248,"**Multiline**: Set `multiline` to render a textarea instead of a single-line input"],[585,"**Network connectivity**: Verify CDN is accessible"],[951,"**No step is highlighted:** `currentStep` is omitted, negative, or out of range. Set it to the active step's 0-based index."],[506,"**On-demand loading**: Icons are loaded asynchronously from CDN only when needed"],[787,"**Page Up** / **Page Down**: larger increase or decrease when supported"],[572,"**Performance Benefits:**"],[683,"**Popover:** `data-entering`, `data-exiting`"],[589,"**Preload common icons**: Consider preloading frequently used icons"],[582,"**Provide fallback content** for critical icons to handle loading states"],[883,"**Radio Button:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"],[882,"**RadioGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`